AI GPTs used

Steps I followed
1.Clicked on the dropdown menu at the top and selected the “Select other Board and Port” entry. In the search bar i typed esp32 and clicked the search icon.
2.Clicked on the AI thinker esp32 CAM and clicked the COM5 port. 
3.I Moved to file>example> ESP32 > Camera > CameraWebServer.
4. Located the section in the code where you must enter your Wi-Fi credentials. Replaced the placeholders with my network’s SSID (name) and password
5. Clicked on the “board_config.h” tab in the Arduino IDE. In the select camera model code, i found “CAMERA_MODEL_AI_THINKER” and uncommented it and commented the ESP_EYE that was uncommented earlier
6. i uploaded the code. 
Problems and Solutions
1. The output of the code was hung on "Hard Resetting pin" and was not showing "Serial Monitor


Solution
I clicked on tools>serial monitor. Baud rate was already set to  115200
I uploaded the code again and it was successful
